NAME
       gunzip, zlib_inflate, raw_inflate - DEFLATE decompression

SYNOPSIS
       #include <inflate.h>

       int gunzip(const uint8_t *in, size_t n, uint8_t **out, size_t *outn);
       int zlib_inflate(const uint8_t *in, size_t n, uint8_t **out, size_t *outn);
       int raw_inflate(const uint8_t *in, size_t n, uint8_t **out, size_t *outn);

DESCRIPTION
       Decompresses a DEFLATE stream: gunzip expects a gzip container,
       zlib_inflate a zlib one, and raw_inflate the bare stream.

       The output buffer is allocated by the call and must be freed.
       This is what lets PNG images and compressed HTTP responses be
       read.

RETURN VALUE
       0 on success, negative on malformed input.

SEE ALSO
       image(3), http(3)
